/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features 2D art with spooky kawaii vibes. Do you want cute skins? We have them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1270080/extras/b1399b0675e4369ad8d307987478c4aa.poster.avif?t=1773669128\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1270080/extras/b1399b0675e4369ad8d307987478c4aa.webm?t=1773669128\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1270080/extras/b1399b0675e4369ad8d307987478c4aa.mp4?t=1773669128\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1270080/extras/0cf25ca3cfc3274b0ab51a774ba8bf0e.avif?t=1773669128\" width=615 height=84 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A COOPERATIVE GAME WHERE QUICK REFLEXES WILL SAVE THE DAY!</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Aim and fire</strong> your chromagic: Red beats red, blue beats blue\u2026 easy right?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple enemies with unique mechanics. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shoot your spells and <strong>defeat the hordes before they reach your barrier.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fill your cauldron with magic, coordinate with your partner and cast a <strong>special charm</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change between the twins in <strong>1 player mode</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Coordinate</strong> your powers in 2 <strong>player co-op mode</strong> to overcome all rituals!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORE THE B-HUE-TIFUL MALLORCA\u2019S SCHOOL OF WITCHCRAFT!</